From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:13:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: g16: reuse a leased PB manager of the same
 VM by default

g16_pb_reuse lets a render command reuse the PB manager its pass slot
still leases from a fully retired command of the same VM, without a new
InitBM. Measured on the J604 with a full-window browser animation at
3024x1964@120: 90.3 fps with 104 frames over 20 ms at 0, 119.2 fps with
none at 1; busy time per render command 1228 us -> 768 us, publication to
first firmware event 664 us -> 323 us; the free-block ring words were
2048/2048 after reuse, there were no GPU errors or recoveries, and GPU
rendered screenshots were identical at 0 and 1.

Make 1 the default. Writing 0 restores a fresh manager and InitBM for
every render command from the next publication.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit d924c5e647be4df109936d7535a2371881fa7f14)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
index 97369ac3ba..9537820b91 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
@@ -503,11 +503,11 @@ pub(crate) fn flights() -> usize {
     "G16: render commands in flight at once, 1 (default, the qualified one-at-a-time protocol) or 2 (one render published behind a running render; experimental; runtime 0644)"
 );
 
-/// Storage of `g16_pb_reuse` (runtime 0644, default 0).
-static PB_REUSE: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(0);
+/// Storage of `g16_pb_reuse` (runtime 0644, default 1).
+static PB_REUSE: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(1);
 
 /// Whether a render command may reuse its pass slot's leased PB manager of the same VM
-/// without a new InitBM (experimental).
+/// without a new InitBM (default; 0 gives every render command a fresh manager and InitBM).
 pub(crate) fn pb_reuse() -> bool {
     PB_REUSE.load(Ordering::Relaxed) != 0
 }
@@ -518,7 +518,7 @@ pub(crate) fn pb_reuse() -> bool {
     PB_REUSE_PARM,
     PB_REUSE,
     "g16_pb_reuse",
-    "G16: let a render command reuse the PB manager its pass slot still leases from a fully retired command of the same VM, without a new InitBM (default 0 = a fresh manager and InitBM for every command; experimental; runtime 0644)"
+    "G16: let a render command reuse the PB manager its pass slot still leases from a fully retired command of the same VM, without a new InitBM (default 1; 0 = a fresh manager and InitBM for every command; runtime 0644)"
 );
 
 /// Fragment-only dependency publication has not been qualified on this backend.
